<div class="eng"><div class="lab">GESHE MICHAEL'S ENGLISH (VERBATIM)</div>
<span class="u" data-d="1" data-l="s252S">Those <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s252w3">pleasure beings</span> who are <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s252w2">wrapped in deep meditation</span> at the level we call the &quot;<span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s252w1"><span class="u" data-d="7" data-l="s252m3">realm</span> of <span class="u" data-d="7" data-l="s252m2">limitless</span> <span class="u" data-d="7" data-l="s252m1">space</span></span>&quot; <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s252w5">see</span> the water <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s252w4"><span class="u" data-d="7" data-l="s252m5">as</span> <span class="u" data-d="7" data-l="s252m4">empty space</span></span>, <span class="u" data-d="6" data-l="s252p5">for</span> their ability to <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s252w7">conceptualize</span> <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s252w6">physical matter</span> has <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s252w9">dissolved</span> <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s252w8">altogether</span>.<span class="u" data-d="6" data-l="s252p1"><span class="nul">Closure of the final verb in C05:251, with no separate English word in this row.</span></span><span class="u" data-d="6" data-l="s252p2"><span class="nul">Plurality is fused into beings, with no separate English plural word.</span></span><span class="u" data-d="6" data-l="s252p3"><span class="nul">Agent relation has no separate English word; English subject syntax expresses it.</span></span><span class="u" data-d="6" data-l="s252p4"><span class="nul">Genitive relation is fused into the English conceptualize plus direct-object construction; no separate genitive word.</span></span><span class="u" data-d="6" data-l="s252p6"><span class="nul">Assertive closure, with no separate English word.</span></span></span>
</div>
