<div class="note"><b>AI NOTE</b> &mdash; PROVISIONAL machine alignment by Codex, independent English-first proposal. This concludes the Asvabhava quotation. The opening go closes C05:251, retained as registered row-boundary-spill apparatus. The realm name is an established technical compound; its three members are unique and strictly tighter. snyoms par zhugs pa is the established meditative-absorption predicate, owning wrapped in deep meditation but excluding who are. nam mkhar is the inflected space noun: its r licenses as, and nam mkha is the case-conditioned stem of nam mkha'. 'du shes owns conceptualize; ability to and their are explanatory support in this nominal-to-verbal recast. rnam par owns altogether and bshig dissolved, excluding has. The first phyir carries causal for; final zhes gsungs pa'i phyir is citation framing with no separately translated words here and is omitted. la, ste and bound nominal/genitive endings are omitted where their contribution is distributed through relative-clause and causal syntax; they are not falsely nulled. The level we call, those, the water and supplied articles stay unwrapped. Parallel C16:828 alone appends a heading, and C18:1120 appends asterisks; neither is present in this exact C05 source row. All source text remains verbatim.</div>
